              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "as bodas — \"the wedding anniversary celebration; the wedding feast\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Os meus avós fizeram as bodas de ouro no ano passado. My grandparents celebrated their golden wedding last year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bodas de prata — 25 years; bodas de ouro — 50 years."
            }
          ]
        },
